OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FIan Skelly plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music, with discoveries
OL,8,     Fand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,9,     Fwith familiar favourites.
OL,10,G1300 Classical Live
OL,11,     FElizabeth Alker celebrates summer
OL,12,     Fmusic-making in the UK and beyond,
OL,13,     Fincluding the Spanish National
OL,14,     FOrchestra's debut performance at
OL,15,     Fthe BBC Proms.
OL,16,G1500 Choral Evensong
OL,17,     FSolemn Vespers from Buckfast Abbey
OL,18,     Fon the Feast of St Mary Magdalene,
OL,19,     Fwith music by Scheidemann,
OL,20,     FGuerrero and Martin Baker.
