OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Handel
OL,6,     F3/5. Donald Macleod explores
OL,7,     FHandel's time with the Duke of
OL,8,     FChandos, where he composed major
OL,9,     Fworks including the Chandos
OL,10,     FAnthems and Acis and Galatea.
